    <string name="sheet_aqi_footnote">Ministry (MITECO) air quality index (ICA): the worst pollutant sets the level. Aura takes each pollutant from the nearest station that measures it (O₃ and SO₂ are rarely at the closest one) and uses the averaging windows the ICA is built on: 8 h for O₃, 24 h for particulates. So each one can come from a different station and time, shown below.</string>
